---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import placeholderImage from "../assets/images/place-holder.jpg";
---

<section class="about-story" aria-labelledby="about-story-title">
  <div class="about-story__inner container">
    <Image
      class="about-story__image"
      src={placeholderImage}
      alt="Tijdelijke afbeelding van de werkplaats van Timmerfabriek Sint Nyk"
      widths={[480, 720, 960]}
      sizes="(min-width: 64rem) 50vw, 100vw"
    />

    <div class="about-story__content">
      <span class="about-story__eyebrow text-eyebrow">Wie we zijn</span>
      <h2 id="about-story-title">Dit is Timmerfabriek Sint Nyk</h2>
      <div class="about-story__text">
        <p>
          Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Ut venenatis
          molestie est, vel mattis felis sodales vitae. Proin metus felis,
          lobortis sit amet lacus eu, lobortis luctus tortor. Aenean porta quis
          odio eu malesuada. Vestibulum maximus pharetra ex non vehicula.
        </p>
        <p>
          Donec a lectus nec ligula venenatis lacinia lobortis at urna. Nam
          tincidunt non sapien non pretium. Duis tincidunt libero dapibus dui
          imperdiet condimentum. In egestas, lacus ut venenatis facilisis, lacus
          sapien facilisis mauris, non aliquet nisi leo eget velit.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-story {
    padding-block: 4rem;
    background: var(--color-white);
  }

  .about-story__inner {
    display: grid;
    gap: 3rem;
  }

  .about-story__image {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 22rem;
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .about-story__content {
    align-self: center;
  }

  .about-story__eyebrow {
    display: inline-flex;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-heading);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--color-white);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold);
  }

  .about-story h2 {
    max-width: 34rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .about-story__text {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 64rem) {
    .about-story {
      padding-block: 6rem;
    }

    .about-story__inner {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 4rem;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .about-story__image {
      height: 32rem;
    }
  }
</style>
